    ("To reduce waste, the cafeteria ___ serving meals on reusable trays.", "began", ["beginning", "to begin", "having begun"], "The sentence needs a main verb for \"the cafeteria.\" Only \"began\" is a finite verb; the others leave the sentence without one."),
