    ("The festival, ___ every August since 1975, draws visitors from around the world.", "held", ["holding", "is held", "holds"], "The phrase between the commas describes the festival, which is held by others, so the past participle \"held\" fits. \"Is held\" and \"holds\" are main verbs."),
